<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Foreign X Kid | Official Site</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset & Base Styles */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0d0d0d;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Navigation Bar */
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.5rem 5%;
      background-color: #141414;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #262626;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #00e5ff;
    }

    nav ul {
      display: flex;
      list-style: none;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    nav a {
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #00e5ff;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6rem 5%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0d0d0d 100%);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
      color: #b3b3b3;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
      background-color: #00e5ff;
      color: #0d0d0d;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background-color: #00b8cc;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Sections */
    section {
      padding: 4rem 5%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      border-left: 4px solid #00e5ff;
      padding-left: 1rem;
    }

    /* Grid Cards */
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background-color: #161616;
      border: 1px solid #262626;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      border-color: #00e5ff;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #a3a3a3;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Contact / Newsletter */
    .contact-box {
      background-color: #161616;
      border: 1px solid #262626;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-box p {
      color: #b3b3b3;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    input[type="email"] {
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      width: 300px;
      max-width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background-color: #0d0d0d;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    button[type="submit"] {
      padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
      background-color: #00e5ff;
      color: #0d0d0d;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    button[type="submit"]:hover {
      background-color: #00b8cc;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 5%;
      border-top: 1px solid #262626;
      color: #737373;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }

    /* Mobile Adjustments */
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.3rem;
      }
      nav ul {
        gap: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header & Navigation -->
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Foreign <span>X</span> Kid</div>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#featured">Drops</a></li>
        <li><a href="#connect">Connect</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Banner -->
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Foreign X Kid</h1>
    <p>Welcome to the official hub of Foreign X Kid. Explore exclusive drops, latest projects, and worldwide culture.</p>
    <a href="#featured" class="btn">Explore Latest</a>
  </div>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">About The Brand</h2>
    <p style="color: #cccccc; max-width: 800px;">
      Foreign X Kid blends global inspiration with bold, next-generation creativity. Whether it is music, streetwear, digital art, or lifestyle content, everything created here is built to stand out without borders.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Cards Section -->
  <section id="featured">
    <h2 class="section-title">Featured Drops</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>01 // Latest Release</h3>
        <p>Check out our newest release, crafted with fresh energy and signature style. Available now across all platforms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>02 // Exclusive Merch</h3>
        <p>Limited-edition apparel and accessories designed for everyday wear. Once a drop sells out, it never returns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>03 // Tour & Events</h3>
        <p>Stay locked in for upcoming live appearances, pop-up shops, and community events near you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Newsletter / Connect Section -->
  <section id="connect">
    <div class="contact-box">
      <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;">Join The Movement</h2>
      <p>Subscribe for early access to new releases, secret links, and announcements.</p>
      <form class="form-group" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Thanks for subscribing to Foreign X Kid!');">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required>
        <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Foreign X Kid. All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
